WEBVTT

00:01:31.530 --> 00:01:33.770
Her desk is just as it was.

00:01:35.490 --> 00:01:38.270
No one knows where she is.

00:01:39.370 --> 00:01:43.580
Honestly, where did she go?

00:01:44.040 --> 00:01:46.760
I hope she comes back someday.

00:01:49.400 --> 00:01:50.580
It's okay.

00:01:51.280 --> 00:01:52.720
You don't have to worry.

00:01:53.730 --> 00:01:56.720
Riku Rei will come back, no matter what...

00:01:57.250 --> 00:01:58.770
Suigin-kun...

00:02:01.320 --> 00:02:03.220
<i>I'll bring her back...</i>

00:02:04.470 --> 00:02:06.530
<i>No matter what!</i>

00:02:09.440 --> 00:02:14.450
Suigin Stands Once Again!

00:02:15.480 --> 00:02:17.280
Great job!

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:27.300
Having a cold one after a 
hard day's work is awesome!

00:02:27.610 --> 00:02:29.500
You're definitely what 
makes us the Gold Busters, Bro!

00:02:29.500 --> 00:02:31.660
You're definitely what makes 
us the Gold Busters, Bro!

00:02:29.500 --> 00:02:33.180
Grave Buster

00:02:30.510 --> 00:02:33.180
Lobby Stage

00:02:31.660 --> 00:02:35.620
I know, right? 
But talk about a bunch of idiots.

00:02:35.620 --> 00:02:38.930
But because of them, 
we raked in a million today.

00:02:37.720 --> 00:02:42.140
Public Saloon

00:02:38.430 --> 00:02:42.140
"Solo Arbor"

00:02:38.930 --> 00:02:43.640
It's always best to attack newbies 
who are stacked with cash.

00:02:44.230 --> 00:02:48.140
You probably shouldn't go around 
saying that in public.

00:02:48.430 --> 00:02:50.380
Huh? Why not?

00:02:50.380 --> 00:02:51.660
Never mind.

00:02:52.860 --> 00:02:53.640
Hey.

00:02:54.530 --> 00:02:56.770
Isn't he acting weird?

00:03:01.520 --> 00:03:03.040
I'll go ask him what's wrong.

00:03:08.620 --> 00:03:10.690
I apologize for the wait.

00:03:13.520 --> 00:03:14.580
So it's completed.

00:03:15.210 --> 00:03:17.130
Yes, finally.

00:03:17.920 --> 00:03:20.460
Well done, Ritrette.

00:03:20.770 --> 00:03:21.680
If you'll excuse me.

00:03:24.090 --> 00:03:28.480
This will show Precious that we can be unpredictable.

00:03:30.310 --> 00:03:31.280
This is...

00:03:31.850 --> 00:03:34.780
You really made this for that woman?

00:03:35.050 --> 00:03:37.060
Stand down, Koshiriko.

00:03:38.340 --> 00:03:43.200
Now that Riku Yuuki is dead, 
that woman is useless.

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:46.650
So why? Why?

00:03:48.190 --> 00:03:51.430
I'm sure you don't understand yet...

00:03:52.040 --> 00:03:55.610
That girl's worth or what it means...

00:03:56.570 --> 00:03:58.020
Temujin-sama...

00:04:02.270 --> 00:04:03.890
Wiped out?

00:04:04.230 --> 00:04:06.890
Yes... That's what he said.

00:04:07.220 --> 00:04:10.560
Wait, but the Generals were...

00:04:10.810 --> 00:04:14.190
They were a team that was like 
the backbone of Precious.

00:04:14.190 --> 00:04:17.950
He was their leader? That guy?

00:04:18.270 --> 00:04:20.890
Yes, apparently...

00:04:21.240 --> 00:04:25.000
Some insanely strong woman 
appeared outta nowhere

00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:28.160
and stripped them of all their belongings.

00:04:30.420 --> 00:04:31.960
A woman?

00:04:31.960 --> 00:04:33.720
That mainstay team?

00:04:34.210 --> 00:04:35.500
Yes...

00:04:35.500 --> 00:04:38.810
No way! I'm sure it was like a huge 
internal dispute within the team.

00:04:39.550 --> 00:04:43.370
Not to mention their leader should 
be someone awesome like me.

00:04:48.790 --> 00:04:51.280
All right! Another day filled with mugging!

00:04:51.640 --> 00:04:57.440
All right. Let's have you leave 
behind all your belongings.

00:04:58.900 --> 00:05:00.580
S-Save us!

00:05:00.580 --> 00:05:02.300
We'll pay you!

00:05:02.300 --> 00:05:03.840
Please spare our lives!

00:05:05.510 --> 00:05:10.410
Let me give you amateurs 
a little word of advice.

00:05:11.450 --> 00:05:14.500
In <i>Grave Buster</i>, money is life.

00:05:14.740 --> 00:05:21.770
If you run out of money you'll be
 forcibly logged out and your account killed.

00:05:21.770 --> 00:05:23.820
That's a great line!

00:05:24.110 --> 00:05:25.550
That was pretty...

00:05:25.550 --> 00:05:27.690
Lame.

00:05:27.690 --> 00:05:30.600
Let's see... "Money is life."

00:05:38.080 --> 00:05:41.630
We've got ourselves a customer.

00:05:46.250 --> 00:05:49.750
Bro's financial power went 
over fifty million!

00:05:49.980 --> 00:05:55.250
H-Huh? O-Oh, no! My belongings!

00:05:57.850 --> 00:05:59.720
Next customer, please.

00:06:13.290 --> 00:06:15.450
Who the hell are you?

00:06:16.250 --> 00:06:22.060
Despite your lack of skill, you have 
something pretty interesting.

00:06:23.200 --> 00:06:24.350
A woman?

00:06:50.450 --> 00:06:52.010
That's as far as you go.

00:06:52.790 --> 00:06:57.080
Despite how he looks, he is our leader.

00:06:58.080 --> 00:07:00.450
Well done, you guys!

00:07:00.990 --> 00:07:03.450
Now, why don't you put that gun down?

00:07:20.320 --> 00:07:23.420
Now, hand over the goods.

00:07:26.110 --> 00:07:28.690
W-Wait! One sec!

00:07:28.690 --> 00:07:31.840
W-We'll hand over their Buster Items!

00:07:32.900 --> 00:07:36.390
Their Electron Sword, 
Freeze Lance and Quartet Mark!

00:07:36.850 --> 00:07:38.080
Bro...

00:07:38.080 --> 00:07:39.910
I knew it.

00:07:41.340 --> 00:07:43.870
They're all super rare items!

00:07:44.290 --> 00:07:46.580
Not a bad deal, right?

00:07:47.180 --> 00:07:49.650
And look!

00:07:49.650 --> 00:07:53.560
And those guys had this. 
Yeah, you know... that one thing...

00:07:53.560 --> 00:07:56.080
Awesome, right? It really is!

00:07:59.820 --> 00:08:01.930
Just kidding, you idiot.

00:08:02.330 --> 00:08:03.720
Bro...

00:08:03.720 --> 00:08:05.760
In a way, this is rather refreshing.

00:08:05.760 --> 00:08:07.800
He's seriously trash.

00:08:08.480 --> 00:08:11.940
A sword that drains the opponent's 
financial power, was it?

00:08:12.930 --> 00:08:15.900
But I'm pretty sure...

00:08:15.900 --> 00:08:20.220
that sword takes away from 
whoever has less money, doesn't it?

00:08:20.670 --> 00:08:26.350
Despite how I look, I have 
about fifty million...

00:08:37.270 --> 00:08:39.690
C-Could you be...

00:08:40.370 --> 00:08:43.430
One of the five players in this world...

00:08:43.430 --> 00:08:44.660
...who has over a hundred million?

00:08:49.130 --> 00:08:53.250
O-One of the Billion Players?!

00:08:56.480 --> 00:08:58.670
I don't mind giving it to you.

00:08:59.430 --> 00:09:02.420
If you think you can handle it...

00:09:29.660 --> 00:09:31.440
So you're ready?

00:09:31.820 --> 00:09:32.600
Yeah.

00:09:35.320 --> 00:09:36.900
I know where I need to go.

00:09:55.780 --> 00:09:57.990
That was close!

00:09:57.990 --> 00:10:00.160
This actually saved us.

00:10:00.160 --> 00:10:01.660
Bro...

00:10:03.680 --> 00:10:05.120
Bro!

00:10:05.120 --> 00:10:09.120
Bro! Bro!

00:10:10.960 --> 00:10:12.130
Hey, that's her.

00:10:13.490 --> 00:10:14.790
Hey, you.

00:10:15.390 --> 00:10:17.470
Let's at least hear your name!

00:10:18.220 --> 00:10:20.520
My name is the Collector.

00:10:21.200 --> 00:10:26.730
I'm a woman who lives solely 
to kill you tomb raiders!

00:10:34.140 --> 00:10:35.560
The Collector...

00:10:36.420 --> 00:10:38.410
B-Bro!

00:10:38.410 --> 00:10:41.780
Bro! Wake up!

00:10:42.150 --> 00:10:45.460
Money is over.

00:10:46.920 --> 00:10:51.380
Bro!

00:10:56.930 --> 00:10:59.690
The one who dares to defy Precious...

00:11:00.810 --> 00:11:03.600
Their name is the Collector.

00:11:06.840 --> 00:11:09.010
Those who defy us...

00:11:10.820 --> 00:11:12.940
shall die!

00:12:59.930 --> 00:13:04.950
Next Time
Suigin Meets Takeshi!

00:13:04.950 --> 00:13:08.950
The Silver Guardian!
